# COPY log/NARM/NARM_30music__days[125-65]_pcount[5]_ptime[30-1000000]_length[2-90]_recent[90]/ /workspace/log/NARM/NARM_30music__days[125-65]_pcount[5]_ptime[30-1000000]_length[2-90]_recent[90]/
